{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"b1-grammar-adjektivendungen","level":"B1","topic":"Adjektive","title":{"de":"Adjektivendungen","bn":"Adjective endings: বিশেষণের শেষের পরিবর্তন"},"summary":"article, gender ও case অনুযায়ী adjective-এর শেষে -e, -en, -er, -es।","intro":[{"kind":"text","text":"German-এ adjective-এর শেষে -e, -en, -er, -es ইত্যাদি পরিবর্তন হতে পারে।"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"ein schönes Haus","en":"a beautiful house","bn":"একটি সুন্দর বাড়ি"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"কেন schönes, শুধু schön নয়? কারণ Haus হলো neuter noun এবং এখানে ein-এর সঙ্গে Nominativ/Akkusativ রূপে adjective ending -es হয়েছে।"}],"sections":[{"heading":"সহজ উদাহরণ","blocks":[{"kind":"table","rows":[["German","বাংলা"],["der nette Mann","ভালো লোকটি"],["die nette Frau","ভালো মহিলাটি"],["das nette Kind","ভালো শিশুটি"],["ein netter Mann","একজন ভালো লোক"],["eine nette Frau","একজন ভালো মহিলা"],["ein nettes Kind","একটি ভালো শিশু"]]}]},{"heading":"Case বদলালে ending বদলাতে পারে","blocks":[{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich sehe den netten Mann.","en":"I see the nice man.","bn":"আমি ভালো লোকটিকে দেখছি।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"এখানে der Mann Akkusativ হওয়ায় den Mann, আর adjective হয়েছে netten।"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich helfe dem netten Mann.","en":"I help the nice man.","bn":"আমি ভালো লোকটিকে সাহায্য করি।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"এখানে helfen Dativ নেয়, তাই dem netten Mann।"},{"kind":"text","text":"B1-এ কী শিখবে?"},{"kind":"list","items":["Definite article-এর পরে: der gute Mann","Indefinite article-এর পরে: ein guter Mann","Dativ-এ: mit einem guten Mann","Plural-এ: mit netten Freunden"]},{"kind":"text","text":"টিপ: শুধু ending মুখস্থ না করে noun-এর gender এবং case শনাক্ত করার অভ্যাস করো।"}]}],"test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-adjektivendungen-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"ein ___ Haus (schön)","options":["schöne","schönes","schöner"],"answer":1,"explanation":"neuter + ein (Nominativ/Akkusativ) → -es: ein schönes Haus।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-adjektivendungen-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"der ___ Mann (nett)","options":["nette","netter","netten"],"answer":0,"explanation":"der-এর পরে Nominativ: der nette Mann।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-adjektivendungen-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"ein ___ Mann (nett)","options":["nette","netten","netter"],"answer":2,"explanation":"ein + masculine Nominativ → -er: ein netter Mann।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-adjektivendungen-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich sehe den ___ Mann.","options":["nette","netten","netter"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Akkusativ masculine: den netten Mann।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-adjektivendungen-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich helfe dem ___ Mann.","options":["netten","nette","netter"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Dativ: dem netten Mann।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-adjektivendungen-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"mit ___ Freunden (nett, Plural)","options":["nette","netter","netten"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Dativ plural: mit netten Freunden।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"b1-grammar-adjektivendungen","level":"B1","test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-adjektivendungen-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"ein ___ Haus (schön)","options":["schöne","schönes","schöner"],"answer":1,"explanation":"neuter + ein (Nominativ/Akkusativ) → -es: ein schönes Haus।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-adjektivendungen-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"der ___ Mann (nett)","options":["nette","netter","netten"],"answer":0,"explanation":"der-এর পরে Nominativ: der nette Mann।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-adjektivendungen-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"ein ___ Mann (nett)","options":["nette","netten","netter"],"answer":2,"explanation":"ein + masculine Nominativ → -er: ein netter Mann।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-adjektivendungen-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich sehe den ___ Mann.","options":["nette","netten","netter"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Akkusativ masculine: den netten Mann।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-adjektivendungen-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich helfe dem ___ Mann.","options":["netten","nette","netter"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Dativ: dem netten Mann।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-adjektivendungen-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"mi